hadiths[21]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ham Khandaq ke din namaz se roke gaye, yahan tak ke Maghrib ke ba'd raat ka kafi hissa guzar gaya jab tak ke hamari kifayat kar di gayi, aur wahi Allah Ta'ala ka farman hai: ﴿وَكَفَى اللهُ الْمُؤْمِنِينَ الْقِتَالَ وَكَانَ اللَّهُ قَوِيًّا عَزِيزًا﴾ [Al-Ahzab: 25] 'Aur Allah ne mominon ko jang mein kafi kar diya, aur Allah nihayat quwwat wala, ghalib hai.' Unhon ne kaha: 'To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Bilal ko bulaya aur unhen hukm diya, to unhon ne Zuhr ke liye iqamat kahi, Aap ne use padha aur us ki namaz ko usi tarah khubi se ada farmaya jaise Aap use waqt par padhte the, phir Asr ki iqamat kahi to Aap ne use isi tarah padha, phir Maghrib ki iqamat kahi to Aap ne use isi tarah padha, phir Isha ki iqamat kahi to Aap ne use bhi isi tarah padha.' Unhon ne kaha: Aur yeh us se pehle tha ke Allah Azz wa Jall salat-ul-khauf ke bare mein yeh nazil farmata: ﴿فَرِجَالًا أَوْ رُكْبَانًا﴾ [Al-Baqarah: 239]."
"2","[AI-translation] Hazrat Talhah bin Ubaidullah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, woh farmate hain: Najd ke rehne walon mein se ek aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya, us ke sar ke baal bikhre hue the, us ki aawaz ki gunj sunai de rahi thi magar samajh nahin aa raha tha ke woh kya keh raha hai, yahan tak ke woh qareeb aaya to maloom hua ke woh Islam ke bare mein pooch raha hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Din raat mein paanch namazen [tum par farz hain].' Us ne kaha: Kya in ke siwa mere zimme kuch aur hai? Aap ne farmaya: 'Nahin, siwae is ke ke tum nafl padho.' Ravi kehte hain: Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use Ramadan ke mahine ke roze ka zikr kiya. Us ne kaha: Kya is ke siwa mere zimme kuch aur hai? Aap ne farmaya: 'Nahin, siwae is ke ke tum nafl rakho.' Ravi kehte hain: Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use sadqe [zakat] ka zikr kiya. Us ne kaha: Kya is ke siwa mere zimme kuch aur hai? Aap ne farmaya: 'Nahin, siwae is ke ke tum nafl sadqa karo.' Phir woh aadmi peeth pher kar gaya aur yeh keh raha tha: Allah ki qasam! Main is par na izafa karunga na kami karunga. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Agar us ne sach kaha to kamyab ho gaya.'"
"3","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko hukm diya gaya tha ke saat haddiyon par sajda karen aur kapde aur baal na sameten."
"4","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko hukm diya gaya ke saat [a'za] par sajda karen: Dono hathon, peshani, naak, dono ghutnon aur [pairon ki] ungliyon ke kinaron par; aur Aap ko mana kiya gaya ke [namaz mein] baal aur kapde sameten. Sufyan (Rahimahullah) kehte hain: Aur Ibn Tawus [Rahimahullah] ne hamen karke dikhaya: Us ne apna hath apni peshani par rakha, phir use apni naak par se guzara yahan tak ke naak ke kinare tak pahunchaya, phir kaha: Mere walid [Tawus Rahimahullah] is ko ek [uzw] shumar karte the."
"5","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Abi Sa'id Maqburi (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Hazrat Abu Rafi (Raziyallahu anhu), jo Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke aazad karda ghulam the, ko dekha ke woh Hazrat Hasan bin Ali (Raziyallahu anhuma) ke paas se guzre jo namaz padh rahe the, aur unhon ne apni gudi mein balon ki choti ghusai [lapeti] hui thi. To Abu Rafi ne use khol diya. Hasan un ki taraf ghusse se mutawajjah hue. To Abu Rafi ne kaha: Apni namaz ki taraf mutawajjah raho aur ghussa na karo, kyunke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Yeh shaitan ka hissa hai', yani shaitan ki baithak, yani us ki choti ghusane ki jagah."
"6","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mihjan (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath ek majlis mein the, phir namaz ke liye azan kahi gayi. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khade hue aur namaz padhi, phir wapas aae jabke Mihjan apni jagah par baithe hue the. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: 'Tumhen logon ke sath namaz padhne se kis ne roka? Kya tum musalman aadmi nahin ho?!' Unhon ne kaha: Kyun nahin, Ya Rasulullah, lekin main apne ghar walon mein [ghar par] namaz padh chuka tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: 'Jab tum aao to logon ke sath namaz padho, agarche tum padh chuke ho.'"
"7","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, woh farmate hain: Hazrat Mu'adh bin Jabal Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Isha [ya unhon ne kaha: Atamah] padhte, phir wapas ja kar use Bani Salimah mein apni qaum ko padhate. Ravi kehte hain: Phir ek raat Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Isha [ya unhon ne kaha: Atamah] ki namaz mein takheer farmai. Ravi kehte hain: To Mu'adh ne Aap ke sath namaz padhi, phir wapas gaye aur apni qaum ki imamat karai aur Surah Al-Baqarah padhna shuru kar di. To un ke peeche se ek aadmi alag ho gaya aur akele namaz padhi. Us se kaha gaya: Kya tum munafiq ho gae ho? Us ne kaha: Nahin, lekin main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas jaunga aur Aap ko khabar dunga. Phir woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, beshak Aap ne Isha mein takheer farmai, aur Mu'adh ne Aap ke sath namaz padhi, phir wapas aae aur hamen imamat karai aur Surah Al-Baqarah shuru kar di. Jab main ne yeh dekha to peeche hat gaya aur [alag] namaz padh li, aur ham to pano [paani dhone wale oonton] wale log hain, apne hathon se kaam karte hain. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Mu'adh ki taraf mutawajjah hue aur farmaya: 'Kya tum fitna dalne wale ho, ai Mu'adh?! Kya tum fitna dalne wale ho?! Falan surat aur falan surat padho [chhoti suraten].'"
"8","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se aisi hi [riwayat] hai, aur izafa hai: Beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un [Mu'adh] se farmaya: 'Sabbihisma Rabbikal A'la, Wal-laili Iza Yaghsha, Was-sama'i Wat-tariq aur in jaisi [chhoti suraten] padho.' Sufyan kehte hain: To main ne Amr bin Dinar se kaha: Beshak Abu Zubair kehte hain: Un se farmaya: 'Sabbihisma Rabbikal A'la, Wal-laili Iza Yaghsha, Was-sama'i Wat-tariq padho.' To Amr ne kaha: Yahi hai ya is jaisa."
"9","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah Ansari (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Mu'adh bin Jabal Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Isha padhte, phir apni qaum ke paas jate aur unhen use padhate; woh un ke liye nafl hoti aur un [qaum] ke liye farz Isha hoti."
"10","[AI-translation] Abu Qilabah (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hamare paas Malik bin Huwairis [Raziyallahu anhu] aae aur hamari masjid mein namaz padhi, aur kaha: Allah ki qasam, beshak main namaz padhta hun aur mera namaaz padhne ka irada nahin, lekin main chahta hun ke tumhen dikhaon ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko kaise namaz padhte dekha. Phir unhon ne zikr kiya ke woh pehli rak'at se khade hote jab khade hone ka irada karte. Ravi kehte hain: Main ne kaha: Unhon ne kaise namaz padhi? Unhon ne kaha: Meri is namaz jaisi."
"11","[AI-translation] Khalid Hazza ki riwayat mein aisi hi [riwayat] hai, ghair is ke ke unhon ne kaha: Phir Malik jab pehli rak'at mein aakhri sajde se sar uthate aur barabar baithe, to zameen par sahara le kar khade hote."
"12","[AI-translation] Abu Nasrah (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Imran bin Husain [Raziyallahu anhu] hamari majlis ke paas se guzre, to qaum mein se ek naujawan un ki taraf khada hua, aur un se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki jung, hajj aur umre mein namaz ke bare mein poocha. To woh aae aur hamare paas khade hue, phir kaha: Beshak is ne mujh se ek baat poochi hai, aur main chahta hun ke tum use suno, ya jaisa unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath jihad kiya, to Aap Madinah wapas aane tak do rak'aton ke siwa namaz nahin padhte the. Aur main ne Aap ke sath hajj kiya, to Aap Madinah wapas aane tak do rak'aton ke siwa namaz nahin padhte the. Aur main Aap ke sath Fath [Makkah] mein hazir raha, to Aap Makkah mein atharah raaten thehre, do rak'aton ke siwa namaz nahin padhte, phir shehr walon se farmate: 'Chaar padho, kyunke ham musafir hain.' Aur main ne Aap ke sath teen umre kiye, do rak'aton ke siwa namaz nahin padhte, aur main ne Abu Bakr ke sath hajj kiya aur jihad kiya, to woh Madinah wapas aane tak do rak'aton ke siwa namaz nahin padhte the. Aur main ne Umar bin Khattab ke sath kayi hajj kiye, to woh Madinah wapas aane tak do rak'aton ke siwa namaz nahin padhte the. Aur Usman ne apni khilafat ke saat salon mein hajj kiya, do rak'aton ke siwa namaz nahin padhte, phir use Mina mein chaar padha."
"13","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Madinah se Makkah aman ki haalat mein safar farmate, Allah Azz wa Jall ke siwa kisi se nahin darte, [phir bhi] do rak'aten padhte."
"14","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Madinah mein Zuhr chaar [rak'aten] padhi, aur Zul-Hulaifah mein Asr do [rak'aten] padhi. Ravi kehte hain: Aur mera khayal hai unhon ne kaha: Aap wahan raat bhar thehre yahan tak ke subah hui."
"15","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ya'la bin Umayyah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Umar bin Khattab [Raziyallahu anhu] se kaha: Allah Azz wa Jall ne farmaya hai: ﴿أَنْ تَقْصُرُوا مِنَ الصَّلَاةِ إِنْ خِفْتُمْ أَنْ يَفْتِنَكُمُ الَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا﴾ [An-Nisa: 101] '[Tum par koi gunah nahin] ke namaz mein qasr karo agar tumhen dar ho ke kafir tumhen fitne mein dalenge', jabke log aman mein aa chuke hain! To Umar ne kaha: Main ne bhi usi par ta'ajjub kiya jis par tum ne ta'ajjub kiya, phir main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha, to Aap ne farmaya: 'Yeh ek sadqa hai jo Allah ne tum par kiya hai, to Us ke sadqe ko qabool karo.'"
"16","[AI-translation] Iyaz bin Abdullah bin Sa'd bin Abi Sarh (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Sa'id Khudri [Raziyallahu anhu] ko dekha ke woh aae jabke Marwan bin Hakam khutba de raha tha. To woh do rak'aten padhne ke liye khade hue. To pahredar un ke paas aae taake unhen bitha den, magar unhon ne baithne se inkar kiya yahan tak ke dono rak'aten padh lin. Phir jab ham namaz se farigh hue to ham un ke paas aae aur un se kaha: Ai Abu Sa'id, qareeb tha ke yeh log tum par toot padte. To unhon ne kaha: Main in dono ko kisi cheez ke liye chhorne wala nahin tha, us cheez ke ba'd jo main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se dekhi. Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha: Ek aadmi aaya jabke Aap khutba de rahe the, to woh masjid mein maili kuchaili haalat mein dakhil hua. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Kya tum ne namaz padhi?' Us ne kaha: Nahin. Aap ne farmaya: 'To do rak'aten padho.' Ravi kehte hain: Phir Aap ne logon ko sadqe par ubhara, to unhon ne kapde dale, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us aadmi ko un mein se do kapde diye. Phir jab agla Juma aaya to woh aadmi aaya jabke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khutba de rahe the. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Kya tum ne namaz padhi?' Us ne kaha: Nahin. Aap ne farmaya: 'To do rak'aten padho.' Ravi kehte hain: Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne logon ko sadqe par ubhara, to us ne apne ek kapda phenk diya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use zor se pukara aur farmaya: 'Ise le lo.' To us ne use le liya. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Is ko dekho! Yeh us Jume ko maili kuchaili haalat mein aaya, to main ne logon ko sadqe ka hukm diya, to unhon ne kapde dale, to main ne use un mein se do kapde diye. Phir jab yeh Juma aaya to main ne logon ko sadqe ka hukm diya, to woh aaya aur apna ek kapda phenk diya.'"
"17","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi aaya jabke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Jume ke din mimbar par khutba de rahe the. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: 'Kya tum ne do rak'aten padhin?' Us ne kaha: Nahin. Aap ne farmaya: 'To [do rak'aten] padho.'"
"18","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi masjid mein dakhil hua jabke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Jume ke din mimbar par khade khutba de rahe the. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: 'Kya tum ne namaz padhi?' Us ne kaha: Nahin. Aap ne farmaya: 'To do rak'aten padho.'"
"19","[AI-translation] Sufyan se Abu Zubair se, Jabir se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se aisi hi [riwayat] hai, aur Abu Zubair ne izafa kiya: Woh Sulaik Ghatafani [Raziyallahu anhu] tha."
"20","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Qatadah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha ke Aap logon ki imamat farma rahe the jabke Umamah bint Abi Al-Aas, jo Zainab bint Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki beti thin, Aap ke kandhe par thin. Jab Aap ruku karte to use utar dete, aur jab sajdon se farigh hote to use wapas utha lete."
"21","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Qatadah Ansari (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) namaz padhte jabke Aap Umamah bint Zainab bint Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko uthae hue the, jo Abu Al-Aas bin Rabi' bin Abd Shams ki [beti] thin; jab Aap sajda farmate to use utar dete, aur jab khade hote to use utha lete."
